    turn. If you Special Summon an "X-Saber" monster(s) from the Extra Deck (except
    during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 "X-Saber" monster from your
    hand or Deck. When an opponent''s monster declares an attack: You can Special
    Summon 1 "X-Saber" monster from your hand.'
